      "description": "#1977: a spare dual-qualified blaster (blasting plus the charging-truck licence every hired blaster arrives with). A random employee_leaves event (e.g. Ai Replacement 'Automate Mine') can land mid-file, its draw weighted by the safety score; without a spare it can strip the roster of its only truck-licensed blaster and charge orders block on no_dual_qualified_employee for good.",
